1. c4 e5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. Nf3 d6 4. d4 Nbd7 5. e4 g6 6. Be2 Bg7 7. O-O O-O 8. Re1 h6 9. Rb1 exd4 10. Nxd4 Nc5 11. Bf1 Re8 12. f3 a5 13. Ndb5 Be6 14. Be3 Nfd7 15. Qd2 Kh7 16. Nd5 Bxd5 17. cxd5 Rf8 18. Nd4 Ne5 19. Qc2 Qe7 20. b3 Rfe8 21. a3 c6 22. dxc6 bxc6 23. Rec1 Ne6 24. Rd1 d5 25. Nxe6 Qxe6 26. Bd4 Kh8 27. Qb2 Rg8 28. exd5 Qf5 29. dxc6 Nxc6 30. Bxg7+ Rxg7 31. Rbc1 Nd8 32. Bd3 Qg5 33. Bc4 Kh7 34. Qf2 Ne6 35. Bxe6 fxe6 36. Rc5 Qe7 37. Qc2 Ra7 38. Re1 Qd6 39. Rc6 Qd4+ 40. Qf2 e5 41. Rc5 Rge7 42. Qxd4 exd4 43. Rxe7+ Rxe7 44. Rxa5 Re3 45. b4 Rb3 46. Ra7+ Kg8 47. Kf2 Rb2+ 48. Kg3 d3 49. Rd7 Rb3 50. Kf4 Rxa3 51. Ke3 Rb3 52. Rb7 d2+ {("Too quick. Black should wait" (BC))} 53. Kxd2 Rb2+ 54. Kc3 Rxg2 55. b5 Rxh2 56. b6 Rh1 57. Rd7 h5 58. b7 Rb1 59. Rd8+ Kf7 60. b8=Q Rxb8 61. Rxb8 Kf6 62. Kd4 Kf5 63. Rf8+ Kg5 64. Ke5 Kh4 65. Rg8 Kg5 66. f4+ {Source: BC scoresheet} 1-0

